  "limits": [
    "Public kernel checks exercise one-step B2 D5/D9 native and whole-halo operators, local-memory state updates, and a one-step Grose reconstruction.",
    "The small time loop implements only the fixed H24 B2 domain; it does not implement N20 moving-window recentering or the full production observer suite.",
